# https://github.com/sbt/sbt/issues/9707
# Pipelining defers javac, so JavaThenScala cannot be honoured for a subproject
# that mixes Java and Scala, and is rejected instead of silently compiling as
# if Mixed had been configured.
-> use/compile

# compileOrder is often set on ThisBuild, so subprojects without Java sources
# must keep compiling.
> scala-only/compile
$ exists scala-only/target/classes/OnlyScala.class
